Tap target creature and put three stun counters on it. (Then exile this card. You may cast the creature later from exile.)

When Creatinator enters, exile target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard with mana value 2 or less.
Equipped creature gets +1/+1 and has "Whenever this creature attacks, copy the exiled card. You may cast it." (You still pay its costs.)
Equip {2}

When 2-Star Fight Club Uniform enters, create a 1/1 colorless Human creature token, then attach this to it.
Equipped creature gets +3/+2 and has "This creature can't be blocked by more than one creature."
Equip {4}
